OL,3,GNEWSAFunding to 'explore' railway
OL,4,Astation development
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #350,000 pot has been approved to
OL,7,Flook into plans to further develop a
OL,8,Fcity's railway station.
OL,10,FThe money from the North East Mayoral
OL,11,FStrategic Authority would be used to
OL,12,F"explore additional platform capacity"
OL,13,Fat Sunderland Station, it said, working
OL,14,Fwith Sunderland City Council and
OL,15,FNetwork Rail.
OL,17,FIt is part of #2.1m plans to upgrade
OL,18,Fthe region's railway infrastructure and
OL,19,Fone of 12 projects to be funded.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
